---
const href = "https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJZ2dCAQDbeEcRp3RFb_K-YOw";
---
<html lang="it">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Lascia una recensione — Yoga Tribù</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        min-height: 100dvh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        background: #f3efe4;
        font-family: -apple-system, sans-serif;
        padding: 48px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      img { height: 56px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
      h1 {
        font-size: 1.55rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: #2a2a2a;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        line-height: 1.2;
      }
      p {
        color: #6b6a5c;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        max-width: 280px;
      }
      a {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #9c9a66;
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: .06em;
        padding: 12px 28px;
        border-radius: 6px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <img src="/logo/logo-completo-ocra.svg" alt="Yoga Tribù">
    <h1>La tua opinione<br>conta per noi</h1>
    <p>Una recensione su Google ci aiuta a portare lo yoga a più persone.</p>
    <a href={href}>Scrivi una recensione</a>
  </body>
</html>
